---
subject: Confirm your new email address for <%= it.appName %>
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<body style="font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; max-width: 560px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 24px; color: #09090b;">
  <h1 style="font-size: 20px; margin: 0 0 16px;">Confirm your new email</h1>
  <p style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0 0 16px;">
    A request was made to change the email address on your <%= it.appName %>
    account to <strong><%= it.newEmail %></strong>. Click the button below to
    confirm this change. The link expires in <%= it.expiresInHours %>
    hour<%= it.expiresInHours === 1 ? '' : 's' %>.
  </p>
  <p style="margin: 24px 0;">
    <a href="<%= it.url %>" style="display: inline-block; padding: 10px 18px; background: #2563eb; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: 600;">Confirm new email</a>
  </p>
  <p style="font-size: 13px; color: #71717a; line-height: 1.5; margin: 16px 0 0;">
    If the button doesn't work, paste this URL into your browser:<br>
    <a href="<%= it.url %>" style="color: #2563eb; word-break: break-all;"><%= it.url %></a>
  </p>
  <p style="font-size: 13px; color: #71717a; margin: 24px 0 0;">
    If you did not request this change, contact support immediately — your
    account may be compromised.
  </p>
</body>
</html>
===TEXT===
Confirm your new email for <%= it.appName %>

A request was made to change the email on your account to <%= it.newEmail %>.
Open the link below to confirm. The link expires in <%= it.expiresInHours %>
hour(s).

  <%= it.url %>

If you did not request this change, contact support immediately.
